  tests/common/google.rs and desktop.rs, tests/fixtures/cloud-code/, and
  src/popover/AgySwitch.test.tsx

They are compiled only with the Cargo feature antigravity-accounts, and
bundled into the interface only when it is built with
QS_ANTIGRAVITY_ACCOUNTS=1; scripts/install.sh turns both on for a build
from source. Without them src/antigravity-off/ (MIT) stands in, and the app
holds no CC BY-NC-SA code: it reads the Antigravity account signed in
through quota-axi, and does not log in or switch accounts.

